WEBVTT

00:37:57.163 --> 00:38:01.038
an alien intelligence that suddenly
decided it wants to wreak havoc

00:38:01.038 --> 00:38:04.371
on humans. That may never happen.

00:38:05.746 --> 00:38:10.204
What you can have is just incredible
power that goes amok.

00:38:10.621 --> 00:38:14.079
So a lot of people would argue that
what's happened in technology in

00:38:14.079 --> 00:38:16.121
the last few years is actually
an example of that.

00:38:16.121 --> 00:38:22.038
You know, social media companies created
these intelligences that were programmed

00:38:22.038 --> 00:38:25.871
to maximally harvest attention,
for example, for sure.

00:38:26.663 --> 00:38:31.454
And they understand this from that turned
out to be in some ways horrifying